Comments:
1. Evaluator: Kiana Setoodehnia, May 26, 2025. 
2. The spin-parities and energies of the resonances are evaluated by K. Setoodehnia.  
3. The alpha spectroscopic factors are from F. de Oliviera et al., Nucl. Phys. A 597 (1996) 231.
4. The gamma-ray partial widths for the resonances come from those of the mirror state scaled for the 19Ne resonance energies. The half-lives of the mirror states 
   are from D. R. Tilley et al., Nucl. Phys. A 595 (1995) 1.  
5. The experimental rate is matched to the TALYS rate at 3.99 GK.
